{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=rescue_clergy|st=careful",{"The collection plate is empty"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Fire stations","Neighbors' garages","A garage with a chest freezer, folks froze more than they ever ate"},false,false,{[1]={{t="first aid, flashlights, rope, tools",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="nobody locks a garage",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=rescue_firefighter|st=careful",{"Do your own searching"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=militia|st=friendly,neutral",{"Armories, shops, farms","Hunting blinds"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the farms are best",afterMs=3500}},[2]={{t="forgotten gear",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Where to find supplies? Wherever I haven't been yet, and I've been most places","I could tell you, but then I'd have to compete with you, and I hate competition","Try the houses off the main roads, nobody checks the bedrooms, the good stuff's in the bedrooms","Houses with the curtains still drawn, the ones nobody's touched, that's where the cans are","Pantries, kid, check the pantries, and the garage freezer if it still has ice","You want my spots? Dream on, {g:pal|lady}, find your own, I'm not giving that up"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Supplies?! You're standing in front of the best supply source in the county, take a guess!"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"One spot, a farmhouse past the creek, and you didn't hear it from me","Try the places that look too sad to check, a kid's room, a nursery, I hate it, but that's where the juice boxes are"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Check the corner stores first, then the apartments above them, people stash food there","Try the basements, always the basements, nobody thinks to look down","Back of the barber shop, the old man kept a pantry, last I checked it was still full","Not telling you, {g:man|lady}, my crew needs it more"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"You want supplies? Take 'em from the ones that have 'em, like me, if you can!"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"There's a church couple blocks over with a storeroom, the pastor's cool, ask him nice"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Truck stops, {g:brother|sister}, always the truck stops, the diner kitchens, the cooler in back","Garages for tools, kitchens for food, bathrooms for pills, same as always","Farm stands on the county road, people left whole crates of canned stuff"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Why would I tell you? So you can beat me to it?"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=club|st=friendly",{"Try the roadside motels, {g:brother|sister}, the vending machines are usually half full"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Information of that kind has a market value, I'd be a fool to give it away","There are caches, I know of three, none of them are free to reveal","The best supplies are always in places the average man does not think to look"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I may know a location or two, for a fair trade"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Don't ask me that, I'll tell you wrong, I get lost, I only know my own hiding spots","Everything's empty, I've been through half the houses on this road, nothing, nothing","Try the kitchens, I guess, but wear gloves, some of them aren't empty"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"No! Don't ask me for anything! I need it all!"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"There was a house with a root cellar, jars of peaches, I almost cried"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Barns, sheds, root cellars, the places nobody breaks into because nobody thinks of them","Old hunting cabins have canned goods, a stove, sometimes a rifle, if you're lucky","Chimneys with smoke- no, wait, don't, that's people, go for the dark ones"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"There's a cabin up the ridge, some canned stuff in the floorboards, I'll draw you a map"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Check with the courthouse, they're keeping a list of cleared buildings","I can't recommend specific locations, but houses off the main road are less likely to be picked clean","Pharmacies and groceries were hit first, try churches and schools, they keep emergency stores","Don't turn uncertainty into permission to break into somebody's home"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Looting is a crime, I'm not going to help you commit one"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=law|st=friendly",{"There's a supply drop we've been using, I'll tell you where if you share what you find"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"All supplies are being collected for distribution, report to the staging area","Looting is prohibited, any necessary supplies will be provided through official channels","Schools and churches are on the survey list, don't enter those without authorization"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Looting will result in detention!"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=military|st=friendly",{"There's a ration point at the base, if you can get there"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I don't know, I never get to go on supply runs, they say I'm too jumpy"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Farms, mostly, folks who left their larders full, but ask first, someone might still be home","Feed stores, silos, we've already cleaned out the ones near us"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=militia|st=friendly",{"Come to our barn, we'll share what we have, it's not much but it's honest"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","st=friendly,neutral",{"I can't point you to a place I know is stocked - I haven't checked"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","st=careful",{"Even if I knew, I wouldn't hand a stranger a shopping list"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","st=hostile",{"Keep looking, somewhere that isn't next to me"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'm still thinking in terms of buying groceries - stupid, isn't it?"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=military,swat,elite|st=neutral,careful",{"No verified supply point to report"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=rescue|st=neutral,friendly",{"A place being quiet doesn't tell you whether anybody needs what's inside"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=worker|st=neutral",{"Everybody remembers the hardware store, that's the trouble with obvious ideas"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=club,outlaw,prison|st=neutral,careful",{"I'd be suspicious of anybody giving away a supposedly untouched place"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=crime,gang,raider|st=careful,hostile",{"Free directions usually mean somebody else gets to do the dangerous part"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly|world=building",{"Church pantries, nobody thinks of a church pantry and every one of 'em had one"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=family|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Not the grocery, everybody did the grocery on the fifth - try the little places"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Vending machines - break rooms, every shop floor in {town} has a break room"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly|world=building",{"Try the fellowship halls, a cold cellar keeps canned goods longer than you'd think"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly",{"Laundromats - sounds dumb, soap, a pop machine, and nobody's been in one since"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=family_elder|st=friendly,neutral|world=building",{"Old folks keep a deep pantry - check houses with a ramp built onto the porch"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=law_deputy|st=neutral",{"I can't send you into a house, I will say the county garage had a pop machine"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral",{"You're asking a sheriff where to steal, I'll pretend that part came out garbled"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Resupply points are gone - try small places nobody ever wrote on a list"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=soldier_green|tmp=fresh|st=neutral",{"We ate a whole case of cracker packs out of a machine in {town} - sorry about that"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=elite|tmp=veteran|st=neutral|world=door",{"Anywhere with one door and no sign, big signs pull big crowds"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=club|st=neutral",{"Bait shops, crackers, jerky, gas cans, and no line at the counter - you're welcome"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=crime_member|st=neutral",{"Storage units, folks put a year of their life in a metal box and paid by the month"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=mercenary|st=neutral",{"I sell locations, first one's free since you look broke - check behind pharmacies"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"Loading docks, half a truck never gets unloaded and nobody remembers the truck"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=family,civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral",{"Any gate with a deer camp sign on it, hunters stock a cabin like a bunker"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=careful",{"I don't know, I really don't - I've been eating out the same cupboard a week"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=law_trooper|st=careful|world=water",{"I'm not giving directions to a break-in - Creek water's free, though"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=swat|st=careful",{"No, a place I name turns into a crowd, and a crowd turns into my problem"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=deserter|st=careful,neutral|world=road",{"Not the roads with the cordon on them, everything else is fair, and I'd hurry"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=militia|st=careful",{"We've cleared everything inside two miles - go further out, and not back through us"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=family|tmp=fresh|st=careful|world=road",{"I've had little luck looking. Doesn't mean you'll find nothing, but don't count on a place being stocked"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=raider|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Sure, I'll tell you a good spot - stand right there and I'll draw you a map - Ha"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=gang|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Everything worth having on this block is already ours - move along"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","role=raider_boss|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"I'll tell you where I've been - go see what I left, which is nothing"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=prison|tmp=predator|st=hostile",{"Find your own, I ain't your parole officer"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=hostile",{"Why don't you go look? That's what I've been doing - on foot, in this heat"}},
{"ASK_LOOT_SPOT","reg=civilian,worker|tmp=seasoned|st=hostile",{"Last two people I gave a spot to went and brought friends - so I'm done with that"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Louisville? it's gone, I think, burned, flooded, I don't know, my cousin lives there, I can't reach him","Don't go there, please, I'm begging you, I saw the smoke, a black column, you could see it from here!","They closed the bridges, both of them, so no one can cross, and the other side is... I don't want to say","Everybody said the city was safest... more police, more EVERYTHING, and now it's the worst place there is","My aunt lives in the Highlands, I keep calling, a busy signal, always a busy signal","I heard it's a graveyard, a million people, and I try not to picture it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Louisville fell first, the big cities always do, too many people, too much panic..","A trucker told me the interstate is a river of cars, all stopped, all empty, with the doors open","There were fires, you could see the glow from the ridge, then the glow stopped, which is worse","Not worth the risk, there's nothing there but the dead, and the people who want to join them","I heard there are survivors in the tall buildings, living on rooftops, waving flags, I'd love to believe it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"Louisville's none of your business!","Go there, see for yourself, I won't stop you","You came from Louisville? Then stay right there, not one step closer","Nobody asks about Louisville unless they came out of it - did you? Let me see your arms"},false,{[4]="SHOW_ARMS"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,99999|hour=22,4",{"You can see a red glow on the horizon, on a clear night, to the north, that's Louisville, still burning"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=militia",{"We lost contact with the city on the second day, every unit sent in, never came out"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=rescue_medical",{"Louisville's hospitals were overwhelmed within hours, I know a doctor there, I haven't heard a thing"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=rescue_clergy",{"Pray for Louisville, the whole city, a million souls, God help us all"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=civilian_loner",{"Never liked the city... and I like it less now -- stay out of it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=fear",{"D-don't say it... don't say Louisville, please"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=sad",{"My sister lived there"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I'll never know",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral|mood=angry",{"Louisville was a trap, and the politicians knew it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly|mood=warm",{"I used to love the city"},false,false,{[1]={{t="the lights, the river, the Derby",afterMs=3200}}}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=raider|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville? It's gone, {g:pal|lady}, burned, overrun, finished","I worked there once, now I wouldn't go back for a million bucks","Whole city's dead, no power, no police, nothing but screaming at night","Smoke over the skyline for three days straight, I saw it from the ridge","Heard a lot of people fled south, towards us, which is why it's getting crowded around here","Louisville's where the money was, so I figure it'll be easy picking, but the dead are in the way"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=raider|st=hostile",{"Louisville? It's over, you want to see it so bad, go, I won't stop you"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=raider|st=friendly",{"My mom lives in Louisville, I haven't heard from her, I don't know what to do","My ex-wife and kids are there... I think about them all the time"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=gang|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville? My whole family's up there, I haven't heard from none of them","West End's on fire, that's what a guy told me","It's chaos, cops couldn't contain it","Heard the stadium turned into a camp, then I heard it turned into a graveyard"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=gang|st=hostile",{"Louisville? Why you asking, huh?"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=gang|st=friendly",{"I've been trying to get through for days, they've got the roads blocked"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=club|st=neutral,careful",{"Rode up to Louisville on Saturday, got turned around at the bridge, soldiers everywhere","I saw the river from Indiana side once, it looked clean, now I bet it's red","City's lost, {g:brother|sister}, no question"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=club|st=hostile",{"Louisville's a tomb, and you're headed there if you don't watch yourself"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=club|st=friendly",{"My daughter's up there, I've been trying to reach her for days"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=crime|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville was a hub for many of my interests, now it's a casualty","The city is likely compromised beyond recovery","Local officials said they had it contained, then stopped talking"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=crime|st=friendly",{"I had connections there, I wonder who survived"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=prison|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville? That's where I was arrested, I won't go back for anything","City's finished, everybody knows it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=prison|st=hostile",{"Why do you want to know? You going back?"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=prison|st=friendly",{"My sister lives in the Highlands, I need to find out if she's alive"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=outlaw|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville is the last place you want to be, take it from me","Heard from a trucker the city's overrun, said he drove through with no lights on","They closed the interstate, nobody gets in or out"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=outlaw|st=friendly",{"I hope the people there are alright, I really do"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=deserter|st=neutral,careful",{"They told us Louisville was lost, we were to hold the line south of it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville Metro is not responding, we've lost contact","They got hit hard and fast, we heard the calls for help on the radio, then nothing","Last report said the downtown was lost, the rest is unknown"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law|st=hostile",{"Do not attempt to travel to Louisville, it is extremely dangerous"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law|st=friendly",{"I have family up there, I'm trying not to think about it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=law_sheriff|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville's a lost cause, I'm told, my deputies lost three trying to get through"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville is quarantined, all roads closed","The situation there is critical","Large-scale response is ongoing, that's what I've been told"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|st=hostile",{"Do not approach Louisville"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|st=friendly",{"I have a buddy there, I'm worried sick"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=soldier_nco|st=neutral,careful",{"They called it a containment zone, it was a slaughter"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=soldier_green|st=neutral,careful",{"I heard it's really bad up there... I hope my cousin is okay"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=elite|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville is not a place anyone wants to go"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=mercenary|st=neutral,careful",{"Louisville's got money in it, if you can get past the dead"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=militia|st=neutral,careful",{"Smoke over the city for days, we could see it from the ridge","Folks from Louisville came down here begging for help, we turned them away, may God forgive us"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=militia|st=friendly",{"We took in a family from Louisville, they told us stories I can't repeat"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"My sister lives in Louisville, off Preston Highway, I haven't heard a thing - you didn't come from there, did you?","We could see it glowing from the hill at night - whole sky orange, I thought it was pretty for a second, and then I felt sick"},false,{[1]="GENERIC"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=0,6",{"They said the bridges into Louisville are shut, but they'll open them for families - we just have to wait"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,9999",{"Don't go to Louisville, please - everybody who went north came back running or didn't come back at all"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Louisville's a little crowded right now, I'd put off the trip","Louisville folks came down 31W the first week, half of 'em were bit, that's how we got it so bad down here"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"Big city means big crowds, big crowds of them, now - don't"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=hostile",{"Go on to Louisville, then, it'll eat you and save me the trouble"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle,cars",{"Drove the Louisville bread route twelve years, last run, the Watterson was bumper to bumper and nobody in the cars"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=worker|st=friendly,neutral|world=vehicle",{"Truck plant up there had a whole second shift that never clocked out"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_medical,rescue_firefighter|st=friendly,neutral",{"Every hospital in Louisville was on diversion by Saturday night - diversion to where, nobody could say"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=rescue|role=rescue_clergy|st=friendly,neutral",{"We had a sister church in Louisville, their bell rang for a whole day, then it didn't"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law,swat|st=friendly,neutral",{"Louisville PD was requesting mutual aid on day one, by day three they quit requesting anything"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral",{"{sir}, Louisville is lost, I'm saying it plain because somebody ought to"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law|role=law_trooper,law_deputy,law_officer|st=friendly,neutral",{"Worked traffic at the county line on 31W the first night - everybody coming out of Louisville had the same look"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=law,swat|st=careful,hostile",{"You're not going north, and neither is anybody else - back up"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|st=friendly,neutral",{"Louisville's been written off, it's marked that way on the map in the command tent"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|tmp=seasoned,veteran|st=friendly,neutral|day=4,9999",{"We pushed a company into the city on day four - came back with half - don't go"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=elite",{"Louisville is a no-go, do not attempt it"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=military|st=careful,hostile",{"Nothing you need to know about Louisville - keep your distance"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=outlaw,raider,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Lot of empty stores in Louisville, lot of hungry dead standing out front of 'em, too - Tempting, though"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=crime|st=friendly,neutral",{"Had a buyer in Louisville - had, now I've got his truck"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=gang|st=friendly,neutral",{"That's home, {g:man|lady} - was, our block burned the second night and I watched it from the interstate"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=club|st=friendly,neutral",{"Rode through Louisville day one to get out, wouldn't ride back for all the chrome in Kentucky"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Louisville's dead, same as you're gonna be if you keep hanging around"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful,hostile",{"Why, you got people there? Nobody's got people there anymore"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"You could see it burning off the ridge on the seventh - the whole north sky"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=family|st=neutral|mood=sad",{"My sister's up there, I've got a phone number in my pocket that don't do anything"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=worker|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|world=vehicle",{"Nothing's come south out of there since the eighth - nothing, not one vehicle"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=rescue_medical|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"The hospitals up there called for help on the fifth - then they quit calling"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=rescue_clergy|st=neutral",{"A million people, I can't hold a number like that in my head, so I don't try"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian|tmp=seasoned|st=neutral|mood=grim",{"I watched the lights go out from my roof, it went in order, that's what I can't shake"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=law_deputy|st=neutral|mood=grim|world=road",{"Last traffic I heard from up there was somebody reading street names - just names"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=soldier_nco|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Louisville's a closed problem, that's the phrase they used, I've chewed on it since"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","role=elite_delta|tmp=veteran|st=neutral",{"Louisville? Nobody I know went back, wouldn't for a thousand bucks"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=club|st=neutral",{"I rode to the bridge on the sixth, I turned around at the bridge - ain't going back"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=raider,crime|tmp=predator|st=hostile,neutral",{"City's full of goods and full of them, everybody wants the first, forgets the second"}},
{"ASK_LOUISVILLE","reg=civilian,family|tmp=fresh|st=hostile|mood=sad",{"Don't, my whole family's up there - don't say that name to me"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd help you if I could, I've got an aspirin and a sock for a sprain"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|st=careful",{"I can't - please, step back","No","I'm not a pharmacy","Find a doctor"},false,false,{[2]={{t="I need everything I have",afterMs=3000}}}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=law|st=friendly,neutral|world=road",{"Medic's down the road at the school gym, they're out of antibiotics, though"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=law|st=careful",{"Not here - move along"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=military,swat,elite|st=friendly,neutral",{"Meds are for our own, try the aid station"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=military,swat,elite|st=careful",{"Negative - step back"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=friendly,neutral",{"Medicine? Everybody wants it, nobody gives it away"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=careful",{"You think I'd share my painkillers? Funny"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=outlaw,raider,gang,club,crime,prison|st=hostile",{"Bleed on somebody else's porch"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","st=friendly,neutral",{"I don't have anything, if I find some, I'll remember you"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","st=hostile",{"Sick? Good - stay away from me"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","role=rescue_medical|st=friendly,neutral",{"I'd give you something if I could, but my stock is for the dying, and even that's thin","Tell me your symptoms, and I'll say what I'd do, but I can't hand over pills"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","role=rescue_medical|st=careful",{"No medicine for strangers"}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=fresh|st=friendly,neutral",{"Medicine? I wish, I've got a half bottle of aspirin, and I need it","No -- I'm so sorry, I don't have anything, not even a bandage!","W-we're out","Ask a nurse, a pharmacist, a vet!","I don't have anything, I'm sorry"},false,false,{[3]={{t="we used the last on my son's arm",afterMs=3500}},[4]={{t="someone who knows",afterMs=3200}},[5]={{t="I'm praying for you",afterMs=3500}}}},
{"ASK_MEDS","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue|tmp=seasoned|st=friendly,neutral",{"Meds are rarer than gold","Try the pharmacy back rooms, the vet clinics, the nursing homes","I can tell you what helps, but I can't give it","If it's serious, find someone who knows medicine"},false,false,{[1]={{t="I've got none to spare",afterMs=3500}}}},
